        <mxCell id="3" value="One shared BreathalyzerSession drives the console, the roadside test and the record. Closing the console does not disconnect the device. Sources: DeviceSettingsModal.tsx, OfficerDashboardScreen.tsx, breathalyzer.ts, breathalyzerBluetooth.ts, Hc06BluetoothModule.java, breathalyzer.ino." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4b5563;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="64" width="1520" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
